    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20054" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλάστ-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλάστη</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κισσίνοις β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					177
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				1.52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.1.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				1.131r
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				ix 191
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph., <i>offspring, offshoot</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μητρὸς β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					533
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέκνων γλυκερὸν β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					1099
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(7).496.3
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Amorgos</span>), etc.; also of animals,
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				206
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ χρυσὲ β. χθονός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Trag.Adesp.</u>
					129.1
				</span></i>
			: also in late Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				7.232d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>excrescence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Hum.</u>
				1
			</span></i>; <i>eruption</i> on the skin, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CD</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>.</div>
